{"seq":2,"slug":"offline-vs-online","title":"离线与在线检测：回看历史还是紧盯当下","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/change-point-detection/foundations/offline-vs-online","wordCount":1506,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"离线与在线检测-回看历史还是紧盯当下\">离线与在线检测：回看历史还是紧盯当下</h1><p>同一个「均值在何处跳变」的问题，交给一位分析师去回顾上个季度的日志，和交给一个 7×24 的监控探针去实时盯着数据流，是两件截然不同的工程。前者可以把整段数据反复看、追求全局最优的切分；后者每来一个点就得当场表态，追求「尽早报警且别乱报」。这条范式分界线贯穿整个变点检测领域，也决定了本 hub 后续离线章与在线章的分工。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两种范式的目标差异\">核心概念：两种范式的目标差异</h2><p>离线（offline / retrospective / batch）检测假设<strong>全部数据已经到齐</strong>。它要输出的是整段序列的一组变点位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{\\hat\\tau_1, \\dots, \\hat\\tau_K\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，优化目标是让分段后的总代价最小——本质是一个全局优化问题。它可以利用变点「之后」的数据来更准地判定变点位置，因此精度上限高，常被当作黄金标准。</p>\n<p>在线（online / sequential）检测面对<strong>逐个到达的数据流</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_1, x_2, \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span>。在每个时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，它只能用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{1:t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 已见到的观测，产出一个二元决策：现在报警，还是继续观察。它优化的不是切分精度，而是「检测延迟」与「误报频率」这对矛盾。二者的对照：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一段时间序列] --&gt; B{数据是否已全部到齐}&#10;    B --&gt;|全部在手| C[离线检测]&#10;    B --&gt;|逐点到达| D[在线检测]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[目标: 全局最优分段]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[可用变点后数据]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[方法: DP / PELT / BinSeg]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[目标: 最小延迟 + 控误报]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[只能用当前及之前]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[方法: CUSUM / BOCPD / SR]\">flowchart TD\n    A[一段时间序列] --&gt; B{数据是否已全部到齐}\n    B --&gt;|全部在手| C[离线检测]\n    B --&gt;|逐点到达| D[在线检测]\n    C --&gt; C1[目标: 全局最优分段]\n    C --&gt; C2[可用变点后数据]\n    C --&gt; C3[方法: DP / PELT / BinSeg]\n    D --&gt; D1[目标: 最小延迟 + 控误报]\n    D --&gt; D2[只能用当前及之前]\n    D --&gt; D3[方法: CUSUM / BOCPD / SR]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>离线</th>\n<th>在线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据可见性</td>\n<td>整段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{1:n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{1:t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出</td>\n<td>变点位置集合</td>\n<td>每步「报/不报」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心指标</td>\n<td>分段准确度（F1/覆盖度）</td>\n<td>检测延迟 EDD / 误报 ARL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否用变点后信息</td>\n<td>能</td>\n<td>不能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型复杂度诉求</td>\n<td>一次算完，可承受 O(n²)</td>\n<td>每步 O(1)~O(段数)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表方法</td>\n<td>动态规划、<a href=\"../offline/pelt-binseg\">PELT</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"../online/cusum\">CUSUM</a>、<a href=\"../online/bayesian-online\">BOCPD</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>历史日志分段、金融回测</td>\n<td>实时监控、工业质控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>评估指标的差异非常关键：离线用带容忍边界的 F1、覆盖度（见 <a href=\"../practice/change-point-evaluation\">评估</a>），在线用平均运行长度和期望检测延迟（见 <a href=\"../online/sequential-detection\">序贯检测与延迟</a>）——用错指标是新手常犯的错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检测延迟-在线场景独有的代价\">检测延迟：在线场景独有的代价</h2><p>离线检测里「变点位置准不准」是一维的对错；在线检测里则多了一个时间维度：真变点发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，算法在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\ge \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 时刻才报警，<strong>检测延迟</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = T - \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 就是纯粹的代价。想让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 小，就得对数据的微小变化敏感，但这又会在没有变点时频繁误报。这对矛盾用两个量刻画：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>平均运行长度（ARL, Average Run Length）：在<strong>没有变点</strong>的情况下，平均要多久才会错误地报一次警。ARL 越大越安全，等价于误报率越低。</li>\n<li>期望检测延迟（EDD, Expected Detection Delay）：在<strong>变点确实发生后</strong>，平均要多久才报出来。EDD 越小越灵敏。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任何在线方法都在 ARL 和 EDD 之间权衡，调阈值就是在这条权衡曲线上移动。这套理论在 <a href=\"../online/sequential-detection\">序贯检测与延迟</a> 里系统展开，它也是 <a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/advanced-testing/sequential-testing\">A/B 测试的序贯检验</a> 背后的同一套数学——两者都在回答「持续观测下如何不因为反复偷看数据而失控地误报」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中间地带-滑窗-批在线与准实时\">中间地带：滑窗、批在线与准实时</h2><p>离线与在线不是非黑即白，工程上有大量折衷：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>滑动窗口（sliding window）</strong>：只在最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 个点的窗口内跑一次离线检测，窗口随数据前移。它把离线算法「伪装」成在线，代价是延迟至少一个窗口、且看不到窗口外的历史。</li>\n<li><strong>批在线（mini-batch online）</strong>：数据攒成小批再处理，用吞吐换单点延迟，常见于流处理管线（见 <a href=\"../../stream-processing/foundations/time-windows\">流处理的时间窗口</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>重启式离线（periodic re-segmentation）</strong>：每天/每小时对全量历史重跑一次离线检测。简单可靠，但发现变点的延迟等于重跑周期，只适合对实时性要求不高的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选择哪种，取决于你能容忍的延迟和数据量。下面这条决策链是实践中的常用起点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[需求] --&gt; B{必须秒级/分钟级响应?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{单点内存/算力受限?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[纯在线 CUSUM/BOCPD]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[滑窗离线]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| F{数据量能否一次load?}&#10;    F --&gt;|能| G[纯离线 PELT]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[分块/重启式离线]\">graph TD\n    A[需求] --&gt; B{必须秒级/分钟级响应?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C{单点内存/算力受限?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[纯在线 CUSUM/BOCPD]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[滑窗离线]\n    B --&gt;|否| F{数据量能否一次load?}\n    F --&gt;|能| G[纯离线 PELT]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[分块/重启式离线]</pre><h2 id=\"为什么离线常作为在线的对照基准\">为什么离线常作为在线的对照基准</h2><p>一个反复出现的实践模式：先在历史数据上用离线方法（精度上界）标出「真正的」变点，再拿它当标签去调在线方法的阈值，评估在线方法能以多大延迟、多少误报把这些变点找回来。因为离线能利用变点后的全部信息，它的分段几乎总比在线更贴合真值，所以充当「事后诸葛亮」式的裁判非常合适。这也是为什么本 hub 建议先学离线、再学在线——离线给了你判断在线好坏的尺子。</p>\n<p>需要注意，这个对照并非无懈可击：离线方法本身也会受惩罚项、代价函数选择的影响而偏差，用它当「真值」时要意识到它只是一个高质量的代理，而非绝对真相。真正的评估还是要回到带人工标注的基准数据集（见 <a href=\"../practice/change-point-evaluation\">评估</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>离线检测数据全在手、追求全局最优分段、可利用变点后信息，是精度黄金标准；在线检测数据逐点到、每步决策、只能用历史，追求延迟与误报的平衡。</li>\n<li>在线场景独有「检测延迟」这一时间维度代价，用 ARL（误报间隔）与 EDD（检测延迟）这对量来刻画权衡。</li>\n<li>现实中有滑窗、批在线、重启式离线等大量中间地带，按可容忍延迟与数据规模选择。</li>\n<li>离线方法常被用作在线方法的对照基准与阈值标定来源，但它本身也是代理而非绝对真值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同一 hub：<a href=\"why-change-point\">为何变点检测</a>——问题定义；<a href=\"change-point-taxonomy\">谱系</a>——把这条离线/在线线索并入完整方法地图；<a href=\"../online/sequential-detection\">序贯检测与延迟</a>——ARL/EDD 的严格理论。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/advanced-testing/sequential-testing\">A/B 测试的序贯检验</a>——同源的「持续观测下控误报」数学；<a href=\"../../stream-processing/foundations/time-windows\">流处理的时间窗口</a>——批在线的工程背景。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"离线与在线检测：回看历史还是紧盯当下","id":"离线与在线检测-回看历史还是紧盯当下"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两种范式的目标差异","id":"核心概念-两种范式的目标差异"},{"level":2,"text":"检测延迟：在线场景独有的代价","id":"检测延迟-在线场景独有的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"中间地带：滑窗、批在线与准实时","id":"中间地带-滑窗-批在线与准实时"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么离线常作为在线的对照基准","id":"为什么离线常作为在线的对照基准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何变点检测：找的是「切换的时刻」而非「离群的点」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/change-point-detection/foundations/why-change-point"},"next":{"title":"谱系：一张把所有方法安放到位的地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/change-point-detection/foundations/change-point-taxonomy"}}